---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
const description = 'What Practice Packet collects, and how advertising cookies work here.'
---
<Base title="Privacy | Practice Packet" description={description} path="/privacy/">
  <div class="prose">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>Practice Packet does not ask you to create an account. Worksheets, answer keys, and the new-numbers button run without a login.</p>
  <p>We use Google AdSense to show ads on this site. Google and its partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising at <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads">Google's Ads Settings</a>. Third-party vendors and ad networks may also place and read cookies, or use web beacons, in connection with the ads shown here.</p>
  <p>If you email <a href="mailto:contact@practicepacket.com">contact@practicepacket.com</a>, we receive whatever you put in that message and use it only to reply. Do not send student names or other student records.</p>
  <p>The site is published as static pages. Server logs, if the host keeps them, are the host’s ordinary request logs.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
